.SS "enum \fBstumpless_facility\fP stumpless_get_facility_enum (const char * facility_string)"

.PP
Gets the enum value corresponding to the given facility string\&. \fBThread Safety: MT-Safe\fP This function is thread safe\&.
.PP
\fBAsync Signal Safety: AS-Safe\fP This function is safe to call from signal handlers\&.
.PP
\fBAsync Cancel Safety: AC-Safe\fP This function is safe to call from threads that may be asynchronously cancelled\&.
.PP
\fBSince\fP
.RS 4
release v2\&.1\&.0\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIfacility_string\fP The facility name to get the enum from\&.
.RE
.PP
Clears previous error on success\&.
.PP
Raises STUMPLESS_INVALID_FACILITY on invalid input\&.
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
The enum integer corresponding to the given facility or -1 if the string is not a valid facility name\&. 
.RE
.PP

